---
title: "invest (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_paused: invest(amount, encryptedAmountOut, salt, sealedBidPubKey, signature)
    q_check_paused --> q_check_period: not paused
    q_check_paused --> q_revert_paused: contract paused
    q_check_period --> q_check_sig: block.timestamp in [startTime, endTime]
    q_check_period --> q_revert_period: outside active auction period
    q_check_sig --> q_check_min: signature valid from authorized Legion signer
    q_check_sig --> q_revert_sig: InvalidSignature
    q_check_min --> q_check_salt: amount >= minimumInvestAmount
    q_check_min --> q_revert_min: InsufficientAmount
    q_check_salt --> q_check_pubkey: salt == uint256(uint160(investor))
    q_check_salt --> q_revert_salt: SaltMismatch
    q_check_pubkey --> q_check_point: sealedBidPubKey matches auction publicKey
    q_check_pubkey --> q_revert_pubkey: InvalidPublicKey
    q_check_point --> q_transfer: sealedBidPubKey is valid curve point
    q_check_point --> q_revert_point: InvalidECIESKey
    q_transfer --> q_record: bidToken.transferFrom(investor, address(this), amount)
    q_record --> q_update_total: investorPosition[investor] = Position(amount, encryptedAmountOut, salt, false)
    q_update_total --> q_emit: totalInvestedCapital += amount
    q_emit --> [*]: emit Investment(investor, amount, encryptedAmountOut)
    q_revert_paused --> [*]: revert ContractPaused
    q_revert_period --> [*]: revert OutsideAuctionPeriod
    q_revert_sig --> [*]: revert InvalidSignature
    q_revert_min --> [*]: revert InsufficientAmount
    q_revert_salt --> [*]: revert SaltMismatch
    q_revert_pubkey --> [*]: revert InvalidPublicKey
    q_revert_point --> [*]: revert InvalidECIESKey

    note right of q_record
        INV-001: salt must equal investor address cast to uint256 (binds bid to investor)
        INV-002: encrypted bid cannot be decrypted without private key
        INV-003: investor position records encrypted bid data for later verification
        INV-004: totalInvestedCapital = sum of all position amounts
    end note
